        <TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT">GigabitEthernet1/0/7</TD><TD ALIGN="LEFT"></TD><TD ALIGN="LEFT">vlan 10</TD></TR>
        <TR><TD COLSPAN="3" ALIGN="CENTER">(+42 more interfaces)</TD></TR>
      </TABLE>
    >];
    "sites/north/core/rtr-north-core-01" [shape=diamond, fillcolor="#dbe9f6", color="#2563eb", tooltip="rtr-north-core-01 [router]\nnamespace: sites/north/core\nLayer-3 core router for the North campus. It routes between the campus VLANs (whose gateways sit on sw-north-dist-01) and carries the two backbone fibres of the inter-site ring.\nlabels: env=prod, role=core, site=north\ninterfaces (4):\n  lo0  loopback  192.0.2.1/32, 2001:db8::1/128\n  xe-0/0/0  ethernet  10.1.0.1/30, 2001:db8:1::1/64  00:05:86:01:c0:00\n  xe-0/0/1  ethernet  198.51.100.1/30, 2001:db8:ff:1::1/64  00:05:86:01:c0:01\n  xe-0/0/2  ethernet  198.51.100.10/30, 2001:db8:ff:3::2/64  00:05:86:01:c0:02\nlinks (3):\n  xe-0/0/1 — sites/south/core/rtr-south-core-01:xe-0/0/2  (cable, fiber, 10Gbps)\n  xe-0/0/2 — sites/west/core/rtr-west-core-01:xe-0/0/1  (cable, fiber, 10Gbps)\n  xe-0/0/0 — sites/north/distribution/sw-north-dist-01:Ethernet52/1  (cable, fiber, 10Gbps)", label=<
      <TABLE BORDER="0" CELLBORDER="0" CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="1">
        <TR><TD COLSPAN="3" ALIGN="CENTER"><B>rtr-north-core-01</B></TD></TR>
        <TR><TD COLSPAN="3" ALIGN="CENTER">[router]</TD></TR>
        <TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT">lo0</TD><TD ALIGN="LEFT">192.0.2.1/32, 2001:db8::1/128</TD><TD ALIGN="LEFT"></TD></TR>
        <TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT">xe-0/0/0</TD><TD ALIGN="LEFT">10.1.0.1/30, 2001:db8:1::1/64</TD><TD ALIGN="LEFT"></TD></TR>
        <TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT">xe-0/0/1</TD><TD ALIGN="LEFT">198.51.100.1/30, 2001:db8:ff:1::1/64</TD><TD ALIGN="LEFT"></TD></TR>
